{{- /*
Red, and notice shape for the same reason it is red. This reports that sessions
were killed, which is the precise pretext a phishing mail uses; a button here
would train the reader to click the one in the forgery. Neither arm can render a
link for it — the shape has no slot and the text arm gates on .Action.
*/ -}}
{{- define "session_revoked" -}}
{{- template "chrome.shape_notice" (dict "Doc" . "Accent" "#c0392f" "Tint" "#fdeeec") -}}
{{- end -}}
